I always thought it was a bit odd that all the nethack deities,
including the Lady and Athena, have booming voices. I imagine a booming
voice has to be a deep voice (I've yet to hear a hich-pitched boom).
Shouldn't they have ringing voices or something?
And with hallu, they could vary like colors do...

Moloch's voice clucks: "How darest thou harm my servant!"
The voice of Tyr drones: "Congratulations, mortal!"

When engraving on altar...
A voice (could it be Anhur?) chirps: "Thou shalt pay, infidel!"

... and so on for an army of bleating, belching, singing, roaring,
yodeling gods.



